    "title": "Let's Count Legs",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "Bird has two legs.",
      "Egret has two legs too.",
      "Cow has four legs.",
      "Elephant has four legs too.",
      "Cicada has six legs.",
      "Firefly has six legs too.",
      "Spider has eight legs.",
      "Octopus has eight legs too."
